How about this new character:
The Greenie (Enviromentalist)

You know the type (Ihave a greenie-friend):
Long Hair, protest buttons, carrying pamphlets etc.

Why is it fun to play a greenie ?

A greenie is extremely Lawfull and has unlimited carrying capacity
(up to 52 items that is, and he can't carry anything in bags/chests etc
 probably with the exception of a ice-box)

Since a greenie is extremely lawfull, his charisma ranges from -10 to +100
everytime a greenie does something bad, he'll feel his guilt resting
like lead on his shoulders.
Alignmet I mean, not charisma)

Alignment	Weight of guilt
-10		You collapse under your load and die
-9 to 0		You collapse under your load
1 to 20		Hurting your legs, makes you unable to move
21 to 100	No problem

Armor	
The greenie wears a cloak of displacement [he may never attack at first,
it's bad for his alignment] namely a protest shirt
[this shirt is so full of protests that attacking monsters miis him,
because they are reading his shirt]
Spped boots [a greenie doesn't attack, he runs]

Weapons
A greenie is extremely lawful, and carries no weapons out of principe,
For monsters capable of reading however he has the following
An unlimited number of p[amphlets:
You give the soldier a pamphlet -more-
He starts reading 	90%
HE doesn't understand MArxism very well [gets confused 30%]
HE continues reading [other 70%]
HE is so tired by reeading he falls asleep
HE is no marxist and gets angrym [ you better run now]
The soldier is bored to death by your pamphlet [ 10%]

Also a greenie can #Chat with someone,
with similar effects
You start a conversation on the topic of industrialization and capitalism in the late 17th century -more-
with some reasonable changes of creatuires fleeing
falling asleep
getting confused
and beinmg bored top death [5% 10%]

off course these deaths aren't bad for your alignment.

Soldiers and Greenies:
Soldiers and greenies are no good friends,
so to a greenie Soldiers are Chaotics.
When atteacked by a soldier #Chatting has a side effect
You talk to the soldier about humanity -more-
	...
Convinced by your talk the soldier takes of his weapons and uniform
and deserts the army to start a peacefull life as a shopkeeper

Shopkeepers:
Like the hawaiin shirt, the protest shirt raises the prices,
Talking a SHK to death is impossible


